mood|e|E|happy
--- every range resolves through the pg_range -> pg_type joins: rngtypid, rngmultitypid and rngsubtype
daterange|r|datemultirange|m|date
int4range|r|int4multirange|m|int4
int8range|r|int8multirange|m|int8
numrange|r|nummultirange|m|numeric
tsrange|r|tsmultirange|m|timestamp
tstzrange|r|tstzmultirange|m|timestamptz
--- no pg_enum or pg_range type OID is left without a pg_type row
